# Trivy suppressions for container image scans.
#
# Only container findings belong here. Never suppress a vulnerability in
# code this repository owns.
#
# Every entry needs:
#   - the CVE / vulnerability ID
#   - a written reason
#   - a reviewer
#   - an expiry date (YYYY-MM-DD)
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2099-0001  # reason: no runtime path; reviewer: @name; expires: 2026-12-31
#
# This file is intentionally empty of CVE entries today.
